<p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>

{{#if previousDepartmentName}}
<p>You have been moved from the <strong>{{previousDepartmentName}}</strong> department to the <strong>{{departmentName}}</strong> department at {{organizationName}}.</p>
{{else}}
<p>You have been assigned to the <strong>{{departmentName}}</strong> department at {{organizationName}}.</p>
{{/if}}

<p>If you think this is a mistake, please contact your administrator.</p>
